      "parameters": {
        "color": "#FEEA87",
        "width": 552,
        "height": 872,
        "content": "## 📞 Reassigned Numbers Check — Searchbug (api_rnd)\n\nCheck whether a phone number was reassigned to a new person since a consent / last-contact date — helping you stay TCPA-compliant before you call or text.\n\n### How it works\n1. Enter a phone number and a consent date in the form.\n2. The number is cleaned to digits; the date to YYYY-MM-DD.\n3. Searchbug's Reassigned Numbers Database checks if the number changed hands since that date.\n4. The result (YES / NO / NO_DATA) is turned into plain English and saved to your Google Sheet.\n\n### How to set up\n- [ ] Add your Searchbug CO_CODE + PASS in the HTTP Request (Headers)\n- [ ] Connect your OWN Google Sheets account in the Save node\n- [ ] Change the Document to your own spreadsheet + tab\n- [ ] Add the 9 headers below to row 1 of your tab\n- [ ] Activate and share the form link\n\n### Sheet headers (row 1)\nSubmitted Phone · Cleaned Phone · Consent Date · Reassigned Status · API Phone · API Date · Status Meaning · Raw API Response · Created At\n\n### Customization\n- Add a Slack/email alert after Save for YES (do-not-contact) results.\n- Adjust which statuses count as \"safe\" in the Parse Result node."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
